        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 70514MDI, Medici Leverset with #14 Oval Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Medici Lever with Oval Rose is the perfect finishing touch for period homes. Its rustic style is tempered with a nod to modern tastes for a door lever that is elegant and beautiful. The Medici Leverset with #14 Oval Rose is available in flat black or medium bronze finishes. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions. This old world door leverset will fit 1-3/8 inch to 3 inch thick doors with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Medici Door Lever with Oval Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li> Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Medici Lever with Oval #14 Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-lost-wax-finish.jpg?v=1704354555\" width=\"394\" height=\"189\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Medici Lever with Oval Rose",
                "description": "The Medici Lever with Oval Rose is the perfect finishing touch for period homes. Its rustic style is tempered with a nod to modern tastes for a door lever that is elegant and beautiful. The Medici Leverset with #14 Oval Rose is available in flat black or medium bronze finishes. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions. This old world door leverset will fit 1-3/8 inch to 3 inch thick doors with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. \r\n",
                "keywords": "Cast Bronze Medici Lever with #14 Roses, Medici Lever with Oval Roses, Emtek 70514MDI, Emtek 71014MDI, Emtek 72014MDI, EMT-70514MDI, Medici Lever with Oval #14 Roses, old world levers, Medici Door Lever with Oval Roses, rustic levers, Medici Leverset with #14 Oval Roses,"
